\fs30\fsmilli15333 \cf2 After release, customer rates fall to about 27\'9632 M it/s (about half of full speed), the host is instantaneously saturated, and service P99 violates in 7/7 runs, degrading 5\'9610 ms beyond the quota phase. (iii) The quota phase itself is not "gentle": quotas slice load into pulses and hold service P99 near, sometimes across, the SLO line (9\'9614 ms).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Interpretation.
\f1\b0  Censoring has two stacked consequences. First, 
\f0\b estimation bias
\f1\b0 : the dashboard shows "2.5 cores of headroom" while the host is already 25% over capacity; decisions based on it (release, expand, sell more) turn the hidden gap into a public incident. Second, a 
\f0\b pulse tax
\f1\b0 : quotas protect averages while manufacturing periodic bursts that hurt tails by themselves (consistent with the quota comparisons in Section 4.4). The censoring-aware estimate (throttle evidence plus the throttle fraction \uc0\u8594  the empirical estimate u/(1\u8722 t) (near-exact for saturated demand, \u8804 9% in Section 7.3.2; known bias for bursty patterns \'97 see Section 3.3)) yields 5.00 cores and correctly reports "no headroom; capacity action required", avoiding the self-inflicted release.\

\f0\b Rework (v3cen, 30 rounds x 3 cycles = 90 cycles, five tenants @30%).
\f1\b0  Naive mean 1.54 cores vs truth 5.59 cores (
\f0\b 3.6x under-report
\f1\b0 ); throttle-corrected |error| median 0.55 cores, 
\f0\b 88/90 cycles within +-20%
\f1\b0 ; naive below 70% of truth in 
\f0\b 90/90 cycles
\f1\b0  \'97 direction and magnitude replicate in an independent batch; the correction is not exact (which is why Section 3.3.1 frames it as an empirical heuristic).\

\f0\b Boundaries.
\f1\b0  One quota level (30%); synthetic pegged tenants; the quota-phase SLO outcome fluctuates around the line and should be read as "this host already sits at the overload boundary"; the correct next action (migrate/upgrade/refuse) is beyond the scope of online decision-making here.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa133\partightenfactor0

