\f0\b\fs30\fsmilli15333 \cf2 Reading.
\f1\b0  The fixed-ratio policy ignores all state and walks straight past the knee (Section 4), producing four violation windows \'97 the cleanest counterexample. The three state-aware policies all stop at the knee (3 tenants) with zero violations, showing the knee is reachable from evidence. The candidate is more conservative but exposes an implementation flaw: single-window P999 (n \uc0\u8776  2 samples) is noisy, and round B was falsely paused by one 16.3 ms spike, giving up one safe tenant. 
\f0\b This is direct evidence that pause mechanisms need smoothing/hysteresis/longer windows
\f1\b0  (already on the improvement list). Fairness note: every policy used only decision-time-visible information; allowed/rejected candidates were actually started or withheld (no post-hoc cherry-picking).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

