\f3\fs28\fsmilli14107 ours_p
\f1\fs30\fsmilli15333  phase-profile + pause guardrail) x two phases (random / aligned), on an 
\f0\b identical arrival stream
\f1\b0 (+2 tenants per step, 25 s settle, 15 s dual-service probes) and 
\f0\b identical available evidence
\f1\b0 ; tenant duty 20%/60 s. The quality bar is the primary bar of Section 8.4 (service P99 <= 10 ms AND customer P5 \uc0\u8805  70%); the capacity oracle is the measured bar-qualified capacity (random 28 / aligned 8; fine-scan brackets [28,32)/[8,10)). 
\f0\b Metrics:
\f1\b0  seats at stop, first violating step, 
\f0\b safe VM-hours
\f1\b0  (integral of n before the first violation), and the gap to the oracle.\

\f0\b v1 preliminary (10 rounds, legacy sampling; labeled).
\f1\b0  
\f3\fs28\fsmilli14107 fixed
