\f1\fs30\fsmilli15333  at 8, 
\f3\fs28\fsmilli14107 util80
\f1\fs30\fsmilli15333  never stops (runs to the 40 experiment cap; at the 50% floor bar slow customers appear from n = 30), 
\f3\fs28\fsmilli14107 audible
\f1\fs30\fsmilli15333  opens to 40 in the aligned phase (the independence assumption erases phase correlation \'97 its known failure mode); the fixed 
\f3\fs28\fsmilli14107 ours
\f1\fs30\fsmilli15333  stops at 
\f0\b 8 in the aligned phase
\f1\b0  (profile peak counts 0 \uc0\u8594  2.0 \u8594  4.0 \u8594  6.0, refusing the 10th tenant at 8.4 > 7.2). First four random-phase rounds used the legacy format (no per-customer rates).\

\f0\b v2 complete: all 14 rounds (Figure 20).
