\f0\b Scope:
\f1\b0  14 rounds = 7 policies x 2 phases (one round per cell; the show4/show5 repeat batches and the show6 arrival-order repeat are separate); "audible-style"is a simplified Monte-Carlo re-implementation of the independence-convolution core (
\f0\b not the full AUDIBLE system
\f1\b0 ); its synchronized failure therefore indicts the independence assumption of that core, not the complete original method - a faithful re-implementation against the full system is future work.\

