\fs30\fsmilli15333 \cf2 Arrival-order repeat (show6 seed 42 + show12 seeds 101/202; 24 runs).
\f1\b0  show6 re-ran all seven policies under a second order and reproduced the aligned-phase stop column exactly (audible-style 32, first violation 34; fixed 16; ours 8; ours_p 8; quantile 8; util80 32, first violation 34; worstcase 8), with random-phase stops in a narrow band (ours 18 vs 16; ours_p 20; audible-style 16; util80 32 vs 28; worstcase 8). show12 then re-ran the core three policies under two further orders: 
\f0\b worstcase/ours/ours_p stop at 8 in the aligned phase in every order
\f1\b0 , while random-phase stops vary within a band rather than a point - ours 16/18/18/24 and ours_p 20/20/18/14 across the four orders, worstcase exactly 8 in all of them. The band (~+/-25%) is the honest uncertainty of the random-phase operating point under arrival-order variation; the aligned safety stop is order-invariant.\

