\f1\b0 ; disks are qcow2 thin clones sharing base template images. The 60 s telemetry window saw 210 running VMs (sum vCPU = 288, 5.8x) \'97 running counts fluctuate 210\'96276 over the lifecycle. Usage boundary: no training, no scheduling feedback, no active experiments.\
