\f0\b sufficiency
\f1\b0  of the minimal observation set is an empirical statement over the target workload family (the 14-round comparison plus the C5 intervention), not a theorem; its direct checks (aligned-phase customer evidence, anti-aliasing sampling comparison) are reported where available, with the anti-aliasing experiment listed as future work.\
